              "title": "NJ Zero-Emission Grant Navigator & Regulatory Guide",
              "text": "Examine local New Jersey compliance deadlines, clean-energy grant opportunities, and state smoke testing parameters."
            },
            {
              "num": "",
              "title": "Volvo VNL 860 Component Maintenance Matrix",
              "text": "Review specifications, fluid schedules, and electronic diagnostic codes written for high-mileage line-haul networks."
            },
            {
              "num": "",
              "title": "Northeast Fleet Winterization Matrix",
              "text": "Examine specialized tactics for protecting commercial electrical systems, checking cold cranking amps (CCA), and blocking undercarriage rust."
            },
            {
              "num": "",
              "title": "Commercial Charger Network Planning Blueprint",
              "text": "Analyze technical requirements, electrical switchgear scaling workflows, and utility demand-charge mitigation guidelines written for terminal operators."
            }
          ],
          "cardSpan": 3
        }
      }
